#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/service.md:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Common commands"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/service.md:41
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# --- standalone install CLI only ---\n"
"anima service start          # background (systemd user unit when available)\n"
"anima service start --foreground\n"
"anima service status\n"
"anima service stop\n"
"anima service restart\n"
"anima web start --foreground # standalone Web static server (default :2660; production: web.enabled + service stack)\n"
"\n"
"# --- monorepo / worktree ---\n"
"just dev                     # Habitat (≥10000) + Vite Web (≥5000); proxy via FREEANIMA_URL\n"
"bun run dev:hub              # Habitat foreground; default random ≥10000; skip Habitat TLS (Vite may HTTPS)\n"
"bun run dev:web              # Vite HMR from :5000 (set FREEANIMA_URL to Habitat); browser Habitat = page origin\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/service.md:57
msgid ""
"`anima.service` is a **single-unit stack**: Habitat (`:2658`, REST + SAP + "
"bundled `/web` when `web.enabled` and dist exists) managed by one foreground "
"supervisor."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/service.md:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Web build is never triggered by `service start` / `anima web start`.** Paths:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/service.md:65
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Mode               | When to `build:web`                          | UI                                                      |\n"
"| ------------------ | -------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Standalone release | Forced during `bun run build:cli:executable` | Embedded, served at `/web/*`                            |\n"
"| Source deploy      | Run `bun run build:web` before start         | Habitat `/web/*` when `web.enabled`                     |\n"
"| Dev                | Not required                                 | `just dev` / `dev:hub` + `dev:web` → Web **:5000+** HMR |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/service.md:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "When `config.yaml` has `web.enabled: true` (absent defaults to on) and `src/app/shell/web/dist` (or embedded dist) is present, the stack serves browser Web UI at `http://<host>:2658/web/*` from Habitat (no separate API proxy). Clients store Habitat URL and **Service API Token** (`fa_at_...`) in **Habitat settings**. For standalone static hosting without the Habitat process, use `anima web start --foreground` (default `:2660`) after dist exists. Optional Habitat native TLS listens on **`https://<host>:2659`** when `http.tls.enabled: true` (see [`remote-access.md`](remote-access.md)) — **production only**; source `dev:hub` skips Habitat TLS and lets Vite terminate HTTPS when enabled.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/service.md:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Startup order:** Habitat must pass `GET /rpc/v1/health/probe` (`status: ok`) before `serve()` `onReady` hooks run. `anima service start` waits up to **15 minutes** by default (`FREEANIMA_HUB_READY_TIMEOUT_MS`) because schema migrations run **before** HTTP listen. Remote-tool host disconnects are retried by `@freeanima/shared/rpc-contract` transport (exponential backoff).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/service.md:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "**UI access:**\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/service.md:74
msgid ""
"**Desktop / mobile Portal:** Chat and Habitat inside the Tauri app (not "
"served from Habitat `:2658` unless `web.enabled`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/service.md:74
msgid ""
"**`config.yaml` `web.enabled: true`:** browser UI at `http://<host>:2658/web/"
"*` from Habitat when dist is present (see table above). `web` is bootstrap "
"(not PG). Default Habitat URL in `/web/config.json` is the **page origin**."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/service.md:74
msgid ""
"**Local Web dev (`bun run dev:web`):** Vite from `:5000` with base `/web/` — "
"Chat `http://127.0.0.1:5000/web/chat`, Habitat `…/web/habitat/dashboard`; `/"
"hub` and `/mcp` proxied to `FREEANIMA_URL`. Browser Habitat defaults to page "
"origin; `dev:hub` auto-fills token via `~/.anima/dev-web.token`."
msgstr ""
